Now check ALL crossings at n=6 (broader) for ANY valid non-SC M2:
  n=6 vmax=10: valid M2 tournaments over all crossings=8423, non-SC=2554
  first non-SC: S=(1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7), tau=5/14, score=(1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 4), c3=6
